NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE

This software provides lifestyle and statistical risk information. It is not a
medical device, it does not diagnose or treat any condition, and its estimates
can be wrong. It has not been reviewed or approved by any medical regulator.

Nobody should make a clinical decision based on this code, and nobody should
deploy it to real users without a qualified clinician reviewing the safety
strings, the thresholds, and the risk model for the population it will serve.

