FOOD COMPOSITION DATA

The food values seeded by migration 0003 are widely-published approximations
marked `source: 'placeholder'`. They are NOT taken from the Food Composition
Table for Bangladesh (INFS, University of Dhaka), which is recorded as
`permission_pending` in packs/bd.json and is not reproduced anywhere in this
repository.
